  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Financing Agrochemical Reduction and Management Plus (FARM+) in The Gambia (PPG)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed project objective is to increase climate change resilience in rural and urban areas of the Gambia and reduce the prevalence of and reliance upon hazardous chemicals by supporting resilient, nature positive, and productive land management, contributing to sustainable livelihoods for small-scale farmers.</narrative>
